  "spec": "docs/reference/contracts/shell-state-v1.md",
  "note": "Synthetic keys and values only. The host clock is fixed at updated_at_ms 1700000000000. pushed_frame lists the deterministic fields of the shell_state_updated push an accepted change sends; id (shell-state-updated-<uuid>) and ts (ISO-8601) vary per push. A case without pushed_frame sends no push. The too_large case carries a value one byte over the 8192-byte cap.",
